sunvox_tune_modern.sunvox is NOT in the repo. tests/m3/sunvox_fixtures.sh derives it at test time: the fetched sunvox_tune.sunvox
(see sunvox_tune.sunvox.SOURCE) is loaded and re-saved with the SunVox Library (sv_load + sv_save, tests/m3/sunvox_resave.c), so
the song file version field is the modern VERS 2.1.4.3 that the 2009 BSD engine (I706a) refuses.
